  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p><span style='color:rgb(17,17,17); font-family:-apple-system, Roboto, SegoeUI, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;, Meiryo, &quot;Arial Unicode MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>Manitoba Infrastructure and Transportation is pleased to release the 2023 Manitoba Road Network.</span></p><div><p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:0.0001pt; margin-top:0px;'>&nbsp;</p><p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:1.5rem; margin-top:0px;'><span style='font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'>Fields included [<strong>Alias&nbsp;</strong>(Field Name):&nbsp;</span><span style='font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;, serif; font-size:12pt;'><i>Field description</i></span><span style='font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'>.]</span></p><ul><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>OBJECTID&nbsp;</strong>(OBJECTID):&nbsp;<i>Sequential, unique whole numbers are automatically system generated.</i></span></li><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Route ID</strong>&nbsp;(RouteId):&nbsp;<i>The route's identifier, an information rich key comprised&nbsp;of designation, route name, and route type.</i></span></li><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><i><strong>Route Designation</strong>&nbsp;(RteDesignation): The designated level of government responsible for the road.</i></span></li><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Route Name</strong><i>&nbsp;(RteName): The name of the route, including direction.</i></span></li><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Route Type</strong>&nbsp;(RteType):&nbsp;<i>The type of route, e.g.&nbsp;<strong>PTH</strong>&nbsp;(Provincial Trunk Highway),&nbsp;<strong>PR</strong>&nbsp;(Provincial Road),&nbsp;<strong>Access</strong>&nbsp;(Provincial Access Road)</i></span></li><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Road Number (Signed)</strong>&nbsp;(Road_Number_Signed):&nbsp;<i>A highway number labelling field.</i></span></li><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Shape Length</strong>&nbsp;(Shape__Length):&nbsp;<i>Length in meters automatically system generated.</i></span></li></ul><p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:0.0001pt; margin-top:0px;'>&nbsp;</p><p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:0.0001pt; margin-top:0px;'>&nbsp;</p><p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:0.0001pt; margin-top:0px;'><span style='color:rgb(17,17,17); font-family:-apple-system, Roboto, SegoeUI, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Meiryo UI&quot;, Meiryo, &quot;Arial Unicode MS&quot;, sans-serif;'>Infrastructure et Transports Manitoba est heureux d’annoncer le Réseau Routier du Manitoba 2023</span></p><p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; margin:12pt 0cm;'><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'>Voici les champs prévus [<strong>Titre&nbsp;</strong>(Nom du champ)&nbsp;:&nbsp;<i>Description du champ</i>.]</span></p><ul><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>OBJECTID&nbsp;</strong>(OBJECTID)&nbsp;:&nbsp;<i>Un numéro de série unique automatiquement généré par le système.</i></span></li><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Identificateur de route</strong>&nbsp;(RouteId)&nbsp;:&nbsp;<i>L’identificateur de la route, une information clé qui comprend notamment la désignation, le nom et le type de la route.</i></span></li><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Désignation de la route</strong><i>&nbsp;</i>(RteDesignation)&nbsp;:<i>&nbsp;L’ordre de gouvernement responsable de la route.</i></span></li><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Nom de la route</strong>&nbsp;(RteName)&nbsp;:<i>&nbsp;Le nom de la route, y compris sa direction.</i></span></li><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Type de ro</strong></span><span style='font-family:inherit; font-size:12pt;'><span style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial;'><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>ute</strong>&nbsp;(RteType)&nbsp;:&nbsp;<i>Le type de la route&nbsp;: route provinciale à grande circulation, route provinciale secondaire, route d’accès provinciale, etc.</i></span></li><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Numéro de la route (nombre algébrique)</strong>&nbsp;(Road_Number_Signed)&nbsp;:&nbsp;<i>Un étiquetage numérique de la route.</i></span></li><li><span style='font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12pt;'><strong>Indicateur de longueur</strong>&nbsp;(Shape__Length)&nbsp;:&nbsp;<i>La longueur en mètres automatiquement générée par le système.</i></span></li></ul><p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px; margin-bottom:0.0001pt; margin-top:0px;'>&nbsp;</p><p>Update Frequency: This data represents a snapshot in time and is only updated to correct errors.</p><p>The intended use of this basemap is to provide reference to Manitoba Infrastructure and Transportation network. Limitations of use: This GIS layer represents only those roads that the Manitoba Government is responsible for. It does not include municipal road. This data is a snapshot in time and is not updated.&nbsp;</p><p><span>Source: </span><a target='_blank' href='https://can01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gov.mb.ca%2Fmti%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7CKhushi.Patel%40gov.mb.ca%7Cabdc1f75c1914bc1675108de9653e616%7Cabf64de92a5c4d77baa2a76265367d3a%7C0%7C0%7C639113484273804182%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=WTWH2hw36PJJD5nRund7UVLbnz0z38vsLgD0ztF%2FpBk%3D&amp;reserved=0' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span>https://www.gov.mb.ca/mti/</span></a></p></div>"
